    "group": "Pteraxii Skystalkers",
    "summary": "After this unit shoots in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), if it is not in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of any enemy unit, it can make one of these moves:\n\n- a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move) up to 6\"\n- a Normal move up to 12\", and every model in the unit has to end it wholly within 6\" of an **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit of yours\n\nIf it makes either move, it cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn.",
